## Original Content
Benjamin Netanyahu ameaçou novas retiradas da população de Gaza caso esta não cessasse o lançamento de "papagaios, drones e balões"

## Summary
The European Union has urged Israel to stop 'atrocious' rhetoric from Ben-Gvir. Benjamin Netanyahu has threatened further population withdrawals from Gaza if they cease launching drones, balloons, and other items.

## Key Points
- EU demands Israel to halt Ben-Gvir's inflammatory rhetoric
- Netanyahu threatens population withdrawals from Gaza over ongoing launches
- Conflict involves the use of drones and balloons as incendiary devices
- Geopolitical tensions are highlighted between the EU, Israel, and Gaza


